  data: {
    LLM: "Save your Gou Ji cards (High pairs, 2s, Jokers) to interrupt the game and force your rival to burn their cards. The goal is to 'suppress' your Dui Men.\n\nHelp your partners. Since you can beat any non-Gou Ji play, if your partner plays a low hand (like a pair of 4s) and your right-hand opponent tries to beat it with a pair of 9s, you can slam a pair of Kings to win the trick and let your partner lead again.\n\nThe 'Shao Pai' Trap: Sometimes you should deliberately play a slightly weak Gou Ji (like 4 Jacks) to tempt your rival into wasting their Queens. Once their Queens are gone, your Kings become unstoppable.",
    Player: "Save your Gou Ji cards (High pairs, 2s, Jokers) to interrupt the game and force your rival to burn their cards. The goal is to 'suppress' your Dui Men.\n\nHelp your partners. Since you can beat any non-Gou Ji play, if your partner plays a low hand (like a pair of 4s) and your right-hand opponent tries to beat it with a pair of 9s, you can slam a pair of Kings to win the trick and let your partner lead again.\n\nThe 'Shao Pai' Trap: Sometimes you should deliberately play a slightly weak Gou Ji (like 4 Jacks) to tempt your rival into wasting their Queens. Once their Queens are gone, your Kings become unstoppable.",
